---
// The verdict: all twelve chairs light up.

---
<section class="slide bg-black s-verdict" id="verdict" data-ink="#FFF" data-label="The verdict" data-fx="square" data-fxc="#E5481E">
  <div class="rain" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="inner">
    <div class="vfan" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100"><circle cx="50" cy="50" r="46" fill="none" stroke="#FFF" stroke-width="2.5"/><g class="vb" fill="#FFF"><path d="M50 44C58 30 60 14 50 8C40 14 42 30 50 44Z"/><path d="M50 44C58 30 60 14 50 8C40 14 42 30 50 44Z" transform="rotate(120 50 50)"/><path d="M50 44C58 30 60 14 50 8C40 14 42 30 50 44Z" transform="rotate(240 50 50)"/></g><circle cx="50" cy="50" r="7" fill="#E5481E"/></svg></div>
    <div class="tablebox"><svg viewBox="0 0 1000 386" class="vtable" aria-hidden="true"></svg></div>
    <h2 class="big vword a" style="--d:1.5s;--an:popin">Not just a student.</h2>
    <p class="vsub a" style="--d:2s">Unanimous, just like the film. Eight exhibits, twelve votes, and the fan finally works.</p>
  </div>
</section>
